<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A0.SS1.SSS2" title="In -A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Safety-Critical Adaptive Impedance Control via Nonsmooth Control Barrier Functions under State and Input Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">-A</span>2 </span>Statement <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A0.SS1.SSS3" title="In -A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ Safety-Critical Adaptive Impedance Control via Nonsmooth Control Barrier Functions under State and Input Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">-A</span>3 </span>Statement <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></span></a></li>
