<a href="#Thmremark2.p1.2.2" title="Remark 2 ‣ III-C Fuzzy Logic and Disturbance Observer Design ‣ III Methodology ‣ Safety-Critical Adaptive Impedance Control via Nonsmooth Control Barrier Functions under State and Input Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Remark 2</span></a>.
</span>
